# Solo — one member, no delegation
#
# The simplest possible team: a single Lead, no one to delegate to. Good for
# a quick one-off task, or as the smallest possible starting point to grow
# from later (just add more _MEMBER_ lines).
#
# This file uses ${Provider1}/${Model1} placeholders instead of naming a
# specific provider -- `lmctl quickrun` fills them in with YOUR configured
# providers/models (recorded by `lmctl init`), so this exact file works
# whether you have one provider or several. See
# https://lmctl.com/lmctl/docs/manuals/teamfile-format for what a _MEMBER_
# line means and how to customize this after it's seeded.

_MEMBER_ alias=Lead provider=${Provider1} model="${Model1}"
